#VRML V2.0 utf8
# Project-authored standards fixture (oracle/standards/README.md).
# Clause numbers are those of the Web3D free copy of ISO/IEC 14772-1:1997; equality with the ISO text UNVERIFIED.
# 4.9.3: browsers shall recognize an EXTERNPROTO URL that ends with "#name" to mean the PROTO
# statement for "name" in the given VRML file. The library defines First, then Second. This
# declaration selects Second, which is not the first PROTO of the file.
# 4.9.2: the interface declares no default values; the implementation gives them.
EXTERNPROTO Picked [ field SFFloat radius ] "fragment-library.wrl#Second"
DEF PickedDefault Picked { }
DEF PickedExplicit Picked { radius 0.5 }
